# Credit categories
credits.category.project_leadership=Project Leadership
credits.category.project_leadership.detail=The founder and project administrators who shaped, organized and guided GT New Horizons.

credits.category.original_mod_authors=Original Mod Authors
credits.category.original_mod_authors.detail=The original and joint creators of mods continued or maintained by GT New Horizons.

credits.category.development=Development
credits.category.development.detail=The people who contributed mod code, recipes, configuration, scripts, progression, balance, integrations and performance improvements to GT New Horizons.

credits.category.quests=Quests
credits.category.quests.detail=The people who designed, wrote, implemented, reviewed and maintained the GTNH quest book.

credits.category.gt_multiblocks=GT Multiblocks
credits.category.gt_multiblocks.detail=The original and joint creators of the named GregTech multiblock machines.

credits.category.testing_qa=Testing & Quality Assurance
credits.category.testing_qa.detail=The people who contributed testing, useful reproductions, regression coverage and issue triage.

credits.category.build_infrastructure=Build & Infrastructure
credits.category.build_infrastructure.detail=The people who operated official systems and contributed hosting, build tooling, continuous integration, packaging and release automation.

credits.category.wiki_documentation=Documentation
credits.category.wiki_documentation.detail=The people who contributed wiki content, guides, references and technical or contributor documentation.

credits.category.localization=Localization
credits.category.localization.detail=The people who translated, reviewed and adapted GTNH's text for players across languages and locales.

credits.category.art_media=Art & Media
credits.category.art_media.detail=The people who created GTNH's visual and audio assets, models, interface art, branding and media.

credits.category.community=Community
credits.category.community.detail=The people who supported players, moderated official community spaces and organized community activity.

credits.category.donators=Donors
credits.category.donators.detail=The people who financially supported GT New Horizons through the official GTNH Shop. Each label records the documented donation tier.

